{
  "name": "Cross-post a post to every social media platform",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cross-post a post to every social media platform\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Publishes posts to Instagram, X (Twitter), LinkedIn, TikTok, Facebook, Pinterest, Bluesky, Mastodon, and Threads via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Set your Pinterest board ID in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n- [ ] Replace the sample media URL with your own public image or video URL.\n- [ ] Replace the example captions in the Publish nodes with your own text.\n\n### Customization\n\nReplace the example content, then run the workflow to post everywhere at once. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 632
      },
      "id": "7808efc2-11d5-4f97-8260-18ee33e8f46f",
